| 1 | 0 | 0 | A+B | 0 |
| 2 | 2345,6789 | -7654,3211 | A+B | 1,0000,0000 |
| 3 | 1,0000,0000,0000 | 9999,9999 | A+B | 9999,0000,0001 |
| 4 | 1,0001,0001 | 1,0001,0001 | A-B | 0 |

